========================================================================== ==> Introduction to DevSecOps
Agenda : How to generate a very detail securty state of your application

==> What is DevSecOps : Devops with security mindset
	
==> Scope of DevSecOps : 
	
	Common DevOps activities :
	
	-> Git  	-->   Pre-commit hooks [Security for Accidental secrets, files commits], RBAC to git [r,w, administrate -> repo].
	-> IaC  	-->   Terraform -> Vault [while creating services via teraform the secrets, files utilized by teraform should be access throuh vaults]
	-> Scripting    -->   Python - A good DevSecOps uses only no vulnerable library packges to make sure the scripts are secured.
	-> Containers   -->   Securing the root user, Utilizing distroless images, Following Multi-stage builds - ensure build size is small & end containers have less no of packages.
	-> Kubernetes   -->   DevOPs => Setup Kubernetes Cluster[EKS] directly - Set up =====> VPC [Virtual Private Cloud] --> PS [Personal Subnet] -> EKS [Kubernetes Cluster]
	-> CI/CD        -->   Stages -> SAST -> Container Security - [Trivy] -> DAST -> SCA ====> Tivy Snyk, Docker etc.

